{"storyMeta":{"storyReviewType":"NONE","storyId":"main_15_level_main_15-01_beg","storyGroup":"main_15","storySort":212,"storyDependence":"main_15_level_main_15-01_beg","storyCanShow":0,"storyCode":"15-2","storyName":"执此剑者","storyPic":null,"storyInfo":"特雷西斯进入内化宇宙对抗源石中的意志。","storyCanEnter":1,"storyTxt":"obt/main/level_main_15-01_beg","avgTag":"行动前","unLockType":"STAGE_CLEAR","costItemType":"NONE","costItemId":null,"costItemCount":0,"stageCount":1,"requiredStages":[{"stageId":"main_15-01","minState":"PLAYED","maxState":"COMPLETE"}],"prev":0,"next":2,"characters":["？？？","特雷西斯","“阿斯卡纶”"]},"lines":[{"type":"header","key":"title_test","skippable":"true","mode":"BLACK_MASK","id":0},{"type":"blocker","a":"1","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"0","block":"true","id":1},{"type":"stopmusic","id":2},{"type":"dialog","id":3},{"type":"background","image":"https://media.prts.wiki/f/f4/Avg_bg_50_g19_babeltop_ex2.png","screenadapt":"coverall","id":4},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":5},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"1","block":"true","id":6},{"type":"delay","time":"2","id":7},{"type":"playmusic","key":"https://static.prts.wiki/music/music/avg/m_avg_faceoff_loop.mp3","volume":"0.6","id":8,"musicid":0},{"type":"dialogue","name":"？？？","text":"（未知语言）新的冗余信息？","id":9},{"type":"dialog","id":10},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":11},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_gen_walk_n","id":12},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1297_1#1$1","duration":"1.5","id":13},{"type":"delay","time":"2","id":14},{"type":"dialogue","name":"特雷西斯","text":"这里剩下的，也只有虚无？","id":15,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/5/51/Avg_avg_npc_1297_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","focus":"n","id":16},{"type":"text","text":"他看着那个菱形，就像——","id":17},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1297_1#4$1","id":18},{"type":"dialogue","name":"特雷西斯","text":"......盯着我的眼睛。","id":19,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/a/a2/Avg_avg_npc_1297_1-4$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","focus":"n","id":20},{"type":"text","text":"特雷西斯生平第一次，有了战栗的感觉。","id":21},{"type":"text","text":"但那并非来自他本能的反应，他感知到，一种他无法触碰的意志试图迫使他屈服——","id":22},{"type":"dialog","id":23},{"type":"charslot","id":24},{"type":"camerashake","duration":"1","xstrength":"30","ystrength":"30","vibrato":"30","randomness":"90","fadeout":"true","block":"false","id":25},{"type":"blocker","a":"1","r":"1","g":"1","b":"1","afrom":"0","rfrom":"0","gfrom":"0","bfrom":"0","fadetime":"0.1","block":"true","id":26},{"type":"playsound","key":"$e_skill_skulsrsword","volume":"0.9","id":27},{"type":"effect","name":"$e_bladeline_01_large","rox":"60","roy":"20","roz":"50","layer":"1","id":28},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"1.5","block":"true","id":29},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1297_1#1$1","id":30},{"type":"dialogue","name":"特雷西斯","text":"神明也罢，造物主也罢，直面我。","id":31,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/5/51/Avg_avg_npc_1297_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","focus":"n","id":32},{"type":"text","text":"死寂，冰冷。虚无中，并无一物，也并无回应。","id":33},{"type":"charslot","id":34},{"type":"dialogue","name":"？？？","text":"老师，你不应该来这里。","id":35},{"type":"dialog","id":36},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_gen_walk_n","id":37},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_4132_ascln_1#1$1","duration":"1.5","id":38},{"type":"delay","time":"2","id":39},{"type":"dialogue","name":"“阿斯卡纶”","text":"殿下已经犯下了鲁莽的错误。我不想再次失去我在乎的人，老师。","id":40,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/9/9c/Avg_avg_4132_ascln_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"dialog","id":41},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1297_1#7$1","id":42},{"type":"delay","time":"1.5","id":43},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_4132_ascln_1#1$1","id":44},{"type":"dialogue","name":"“阿斯卡纶”","text":"离开吧，老师，时机尚未成熟。","id":45,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/9/9c/Avg_avg_4132_ascln_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1297_1#1$1","id":46},{"type":"dialogue","name":"特雷西斯","text":"你不应该用她来侮辱我，自诩的造物主。","id":47,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/5/51/Avg_avg_npc_1297_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","focus":"n","id":48},{"type":"text","text":"眼前的阿斯卡纶绝非幻影，这处奇妙的空间具现了他的记忆。","id":49},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1297_1#8$1","id":50},{"type":"dialogue","name":"特雷西斯","text":"你在我的记忆中，依旧还是过去的样子。稚嫩了些。","id":51,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/f/f6/Avg_avg_npc_1297_1-8$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_4132_ascln_1#1$1","id":52},{"type":"dialogue","name":"“阿斯卡纶”","text":"......？","id":53,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/9/9c/Avg_avg_4132_ascln_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1297_1#1$1","id":54},{"type":"dialogue","name":"特雷西斯","text":"既然真正掌控这里的那些人不敢直面我，说明特蕾西娅的确成功了。他们必然已经受到了诸多的限制。","id":55,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/5/51/Avg_avg_npc_1297_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"特雷西斯","text":"否则那些傲慢的存在也不至于试图让你阻止我。","id":56,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/5/51/Avg_avg_npc_1297_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","focus":"n","id":57},{"type":"text","text":"特雷西斯举起了剑。","id":58},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_4132_ascln_1#1$1","id":59},{"type":"dialogue","name":"“阿斯卡纶”","text":"老师，你还是不愿跟我离开？","id":60,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/9/9c/Avg_avg_4132_ascln_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1297_1#1$1","id":61},{"type":"dialogue","name":"特雷西斯","text":"战胜我，如果你真想将我带走。","id":62,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/5/51/Avg_avg_npc_1297_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_4132_ascln_1#1$1","id":63},{"type":"dialogue","name":"“阿斯卡纶”","text":"好。","id":64,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/9/9c/Avg_avg_4132_ascln_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"dialog","id":65},{"type":"charslot","id":66},{"type":"playsound","key":"$knifegore","id":67},{"type":"camerashake","duration":"0.5","xstrength":"30","ystrength":"30","vibrato":"30","randomness":"90","fadeout":"true","block":"false","id":68},{"type":"effect","name":"$e_slash_02_s","layer":"2","id":69},{"type":"effect","name":"$e_spark_01_large","layer":"3","id":70},{"type":"blocker","a":"1","r":"1","g":"1","b":"1","afrom":"0","rfrom":"0","gfrom":"0","bfrom":"0","fadetime":"0.1","block":"true","id":71},{"type":"playsound","key":"$e_skill_skulsrsword","volume":"0.9","id":72},{"type":"playsound","key":"$swordtsing4","delay":"0.1","id":73},{"type":"effect","name":"$e_bladeline_01_large","roy":"20","roz":"292","layer":"1","id":74},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"1.5","block":"true","id":75},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1297_1#1$1","duration":"0.5","id":76},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":77},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","name":"avg_4132_ascln_1#1$1","duration":"1","focus":"m","posfrom":"0,0","posto":"0,0","id":78},{"type":"delay","time":"1.5","id":79},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1297_1#1$1","focus":"m","id":80},{"type":"dialogue","name":"特雷西斯","text":"很熟练，但依旧只是我教你的技巧。","id":81,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/5/51/Avg_avg_npc_1297_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"dialog","id":82},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","name":"avg_4132_ascln_1#1$1","duration":"1.5","afrom":"1","ato":"0","posfrom":"0,0","posto":"150,0","focus":"m","id":83},{"type":"blocker","a":"0.1","r":"0.2","g":"0","b":"0.5","fadetime":"1.5","block":"true","id":84},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","focus":"n","id":85},{"type":"text","text":"“阿斯卡纶”的身形隐入了紫色的雾气之中，那是属于她的源石技艺。","id":86},{"type":"text","text":"特雷西斯想起了他与特蕾西娅带领萨卡兹的残军走入风暴中的那天......","id":87},{"type":"text","text":"他只身走入紫色的烟雾之中，抓住了那个孩子手中的刀。一如此刻。","id":88},{"type":"dialog","id":89},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1297_1#8$1","id":90},{"type":"dialogue","name":"特雷西斯","text":"好久不见，阿斯卡纶。","id":91,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/f/f6/Avg_avg_npc_1297_1-8$1.png"},{"type":"dialog","id":92},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":93},{"type":"blocker","a":"1","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"2","block":"true","id":94},{"type":"stopmusic","fadetime":"2","id":95},{"type":"image","id":96},{"type":"charslot","id":97}],"characters":["？？？","特雷西斯","“阿斯卡纶”"]}